From: YapLabs <folia@yaplabs.com>
Subject: [PATCH] YaP fork correctness: cut AABB, gap, RTQ handoff, portal lookup

Bound regionizer cuts to the corridor section AABB. Maintain the gap on each
shard tick thread. Requeue phase-tagged RTQ on split. Portal couple looks up
by portal chunk region. synchronize(flush) waits for IO. Do not strip PLAYER
tickets. Post-applyAllPatches.
---

